# Two of fight.c's messages, in the temple (3001) with violence_update on. A goblin (3501), made level 60 with 5000
# hit points, wields a small sword (3021, level 60) poisoned and nothing else (values 1 2 4 1 128). Decimus (10,
# given 30000 hit points) fights it until the sword poisons him: "You feel poison coursing through your veins." had
# no line end, so the next message ran on from it (#74). Then Decimus wears a floating disc (23) made to rot at
# death (extra 32768), with a bread in it, and Smokegod (60) slays him: the disc "evaporates, scattering its
# contents." (stock had no space after the comma).
@updates area,violence
@connect dec
Decimus
psswrd
@return
@return
@connect god
Smokegod
smoke123
@return
@return
@obj 3021 3001 1 2 4 1 128
@mob 3501 3001
set obj sword level 60
set char goblin level 60
set char goblin hp 5000
restore goblin
get sword
give sword goblin
force goblin wield sword
set char decimus hp 30000
restore decimus
@as dec
kill goblin
@pulse until 600 coursing
@as god
peace
@obj 23 3001 100 16 0 50 100
@obj 3011 3001
@as dec
get disc
wear disc
get bread
put bread disc
@as god
set obj disc extra 32768
slay decimus
